I am very tired now.
There is a huge crowd in the market.
I see a small tea cart there.
An older man is there.
I ask him for a tea.
"Give me one black tea," I say.
I see hot snacks there.
"I want one Pazham Pori too," I say.
The seller gives me the tea and the Pazham Pori.
The Pazham Pori is very hot.
It is nice and crispy.
It is also very sweet.
I drink the hot black tea.
The tea and snack are very tasty.
"How much is the total?" I ask the seller.
"Twenty-five rupees," the seller says.
I take coins from my bag.
I give him exactly twenty-five rupees.
I feel very energetic now.
